          docsPreview:
            "# Create Update Request\nCreates a new update request to collect information from users.\n## Configuration\n- **Sheet ID**: Sheet for the update request\n- **Row IDs**: Comma-separated row IDs to request updates for\n- **Column IDs**: Comma-separated column IDs to request updates for\n- **Recipient Emails**: Comma-separated recipient emails\n- **Subject**: Email subject line\n- **Message**: Optional message\n- **Output Variable**: Variable for created request\n## Notes\n- Recipients receive email with form to update specified cells\n- Can specify which rows and columns\n- Recurring requests supported",
